  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 5.51,
      "e": 8.18,
      "text": "- I'm with 57th Rescue Squadron,"
    },
    {
      "s": 8.32,
      "e": 9.95,
      "text": "Aircrew Flight Equipment Section."
    },
    {
      "s": 9.95,
      "e": 12.17,
      "text": "We support the pararescue jumper"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.17,
      "e": 16.33,
      "text": "with all means of parachutes and rigging equipment,"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.02,
      "e": 19.02,
      "text": "whether it be air-drops,"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.2,
      "e": 21.45,
      "text": "arks, boats, what-have-you,"
    },
    {
      "s": 22.24,
      "e": 23.81,
      "text": "to get them where they need"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.81,
      "e": 27.98,
      "text": "to recover their patient, victim, or someone in danger."
    },
    {
      "s": 28.64,
      "e": 30.41,
      "text": "It's a very demanding job."
    },
    {
      "s": 30.41,
      "e": 33.42,
      "text": "We've done some exercises and joint exercises,"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.42,
      "e": 36.13,
      "text": "Ares Shadow out of Aviano, Italy,"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.13,
      "e": 39.37,
      "text": "where we had some guys go in and do some jumps over there."
    },
    {
      "s": 39.37,
      "e": 41.38,
      "text": "We've also won for the second time"
    },
    {
      "s": 41.38,
      "e": 43.9,
      "text": "Pararescue Squadron of the Year,"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.9,
      "e": 47.07,
      "text": "which is a significant accomplishment."
    },
    {
      "s": 48.62,
      "e": 51.73,
      "text": "What I do is very important to the mission."
    },
    {
      "s": 51.73,
      "e": 53.48,
      "text": "We are directly impacting"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.48,
      "e": 55.66,
      "text": "what the pararescue jumpers do,"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.66,
      "e": 58.43,
      "text": "what they support, how diverse they are,"
    },
    {
      "s": 58.43,
      "e": 60.56,
      "text": "how worldwide mobile they are,"
    },
    {
      "s": 60.56,
      "e": 62.05,
      "text": "and how they get around,"
    },
    {
      "s": 62.05,
      "e": 65.31,
      "text": "so that is a great job to be a part of."
    }
  ],
